# Zenos yae Galvus, My First Friend: "choose a creature an opponent controls. Until end of turn, creatures other than Zenos yae
# Galvus and the chosen creature get -2/-2." Bot2 has an Ornithopter (0/2) and a Cogwork Librarian (3/3); Bot1 has a Memnite.
# Only an opponent's creature can be chosen: Bot1's own Memnite is refused, and Bot1 chooses Bot2's Ornithopter, which lives
# though it would die at -2/-2. The Librarian is a 1/1 for the turn and a 3/3 again on turn 4; Bot1's own Memnite dies, and Zenos
# stays a 4/4. The Memnite leaving is not the chosen creature leaving: Zenos does not transform.

